{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1723feb1395b115db0dc5fa2f9d7e0c775aef95420030903015ec3230cadb3df",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51f811ccd65ec166940164173f2335bfae0413fa1a46c210fc93ac223949d25b",
      "text": "制作人，辛苦啦。\n啊～今天的派对简直太棒了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eb152cbd6669b9bb49d12fe5fe5b22c7bcd20acefa050a843473122c858397f",
      "text": "吃了好多甜甜圈，而且那些甜甜圈全都是大家帮我精心挑选的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a093ddfefaa6e10a6df31efe84b438159a5801beea614891a9f2b4d19edc1a1",
      "text": "哈哈，一回想起来又想吃了。\n要是甜甜圈的话，来多少我都吃得下啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3428b9ccf9bf6843472a90f41a3a1eb52a59223b4d1fde25281862624af62506",
      "text": "制作人也谢谢你啦。\n你帮我挑的甜甜圈超级好吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:169814eae5833184e7745693262ca2e0d8259d9ede16e04c7ee1454140d823f6",
      "text": "能合您的口味\n真是太好了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16851442aba87346569b3b8219b97189d4575a4a5069b5f7a1994334d51b2e97",
      "text": "简直完完全全戳中了我的喜好哦。\n如果可以的话，我恨不得每天都吃呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cc7539c452000f056a214115b69f013b3430ed737db7904c3ee7ba18f4e0936",
      "text": "最重要的是，●●●●プロデューサー能对我了如指掌，\n我也真的特别高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe91dd76cf26909a8a85cf1eb62d3ddcc3524031f57b2416b68368c0ba01c0ad",
      "text": "真不愧是我们的制作人啊！\n该说你太懂怎么调动我的积极性了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29016cca63c199d729359f7bf68ae222a9e2483362f87ede116f56dd70119593",
      "text": "下次要是还有庆祝活动，我还想吃那个甜甜圈！\n比如新年啊、圣诞节啊，还有演出的庆功宴上！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9f6366cff4d756053bca05b7d58c4df67ae61832f0ee88e4ff653044fdb47f3",
      "text": "包在我身上",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000027:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7007d401bc88763350a18a33bb08e52ea1cc10397e1f41121a17362a1b77c221",
      "text": "看来您真的很喜欢呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f77b8e42d1a8876ca0d29414a6383b4effa0cb20d4d57ecc978fe627ba366276",
      "text": "太棒啦！谢谢制作人！\n当然，甜甜圈会和成员们平分的啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30b0b56bb1e866afce7d63972d563de8e949c0d8eed3da0425da6c3e46d6d17e",
      "text": "或许是因为制作人特意跑去买回来的，\n所以更有种特别的感觉吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000038:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fb9845d427ac5b9a7f0ff915d1acde228b3efb07cd9c6e961cc77d043b5398b",
      "text": "嘿嘿，明天的社团活动我都有干劲了。\n能跟你聊聊真好，那明天事务所见……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000040:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fe316c14d7c9dd14644803034b0809ec23bd998616e935ea481d50334611a3d",
      "text": "啊！制作人的生日我也一定会\n准备超绝美味的甜甜圈的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_22_t01:1_2_023_22_t01:cmd-000042:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6a3c2b4dddb5f514671b21495ba8200f88393af08d358a07c90fbf969bccd56",
      "text": "你要记好，然后满怀期待地等着哦。\n那就晚安啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
